From fefa338718ac73343522c59ae4e59821d385f9ae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Reza Nadimi <rezaxr14@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 15:56:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] hard fix (2026-11-20): reasoning mandatory, archive pre-CoT
 traces, tools+skills default on, v3 deterministic traces, docs 35->10

Reza: no compatibility with bad data, nothing off by default. Findings F1-F10 in docs/AUDITS.md; decisions in docs/DECISIONS.md (2026-11-20).

Traces / CoT
- archive 237 reasoning-free AI traces, deterministic v1/v2 and mixes to data/archive/2026-11-20_pre_cot/ (nothing deleted); stale reports to reports/archive_pre_heldout_v2/
- compact tool contract REQUIRES reasoning before every tool call (default); validate.reasoning_report + transfer.ingest gate reject tool traces without usable reasoning; --require-tools rejects answers with no tool use; models without a reasoning parameter are captured from their visible multi-round prose; tier/topology copied into ingested rows
- tool_traces v3: inspect first, reasoning built from the previous tool result's numbers, recover variants start from a hypothesis; the first call no longer carries the ground-truth answer
- canonical dirs renamed to *_v3 in scripts/kaggle/tests; sync script computes defaults at run time

Harness / tools
- 5 plant + 9 component tools + list_skills/load_skill are the default (make_tools, tool_names, ThermoEnv, agent_graph, compact prompt = catalog of descriptions, bodies only via load_skill); list_skills("") accepts a blank filter
- ledger inspect_plant: truth_MW -> recomputed_MW; ok flags, failed_lines and line names removed
- process_budget_batch.ps1 ingests with --require-tools; overnight loop logs a real per-task tally once per batch

Docs / working method
- docs/ 35 -> 10 files (tests/test_docs_layout.py), generated logs in reports/, stale root plan removed
- USER_PROMPTS_VERBATIM: prompt 9 completed, prompts 12 and 13 added
- data/samples refreshed (tool outputs, skills on demand, deterministic v3 trace)

Tests: tests/test_reasoning_v3.py (gate, grounded reasoning, defaults, ledger tool); older tests updated to the new defaults.
