-| P0-2 | `agent_graph.finalize` does not append the final assistant turn when tool turns exist (text-loop path); `tests/test_agent_graph.py` only asserts `state["final"]`. | Append it. | `sft_completion` ends with the accepted answer. |
-| P0-3 | `docs/TRAINING_DATA_PROTOCOL.md` says to ingest with `transfer.ingest --harness tools`; `transfer.py` has no `--harness` flag. | Remove the flag from the doc (tool use is detected from the record) or add it. | The documented command runs. |
-| P0-4 | Ledger tool crashes on a malformed candidate (`res.error` is None) and reports a per-component first-law residual that is just closure divided by component count. | Real per-line ledger residuals, or drop first/second-law numbers for ledger. | Malformed candidate returns `{"ok": false, "error": ...}`. |
